BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 760 Td (SUPPLY AGREEMENT FOR OFFICE CONSUMABLES) Tj T* () Tj T* (This agreement is made between Fernhill Office Supplies Ltd, a company registered in) Tj T* (England, of 12 Quarry Lane, Exampleton \(the "Supplier"\), and Larkspur Housing Trust,) Tj T* (of 4 Mill Street, Sampleford \(the "Customer"\).) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Supply) Tj T* () Tj T* (1.1 The Supplier will supply paper, toner, stationery and other office consumables) Tj T* (listed in its catalogue, as the Customer orders them from time to time.) Tj T* () Tj T* (1.2 Orders may be placed online or by email. The Supplier will deliver within two) Tj T* (working days of an order.) Tj T* () Tj T* (2. Term) Tj T* () Tj T* (2.1 This agreement starts on 1 April 2026 and continues for an initial term of two) Tj T* (years.) Tj T* () Tj T* (3. Renewal) Tj T* () Tj T* (3.1 At the end of the initial term this agreement renews automatically for successive) Tj T* (periods of 12 months, unless either party gives notice under clause 4.) Tj T* () Tj T* (4. Notice) Tj T* () Tj T* (4.1 Either party may stop the agreement renewing by giving the other at least 90) Tj T* (days' written notice before the end of the initial term or of any renewal period.) Tj T* () Tj T* (5. Prices and payment) Tj T* () Tj T* (5.1 Goods are charged at the prices in the Supplier's catalogue on the date of the) Tj T* (order, less a discount of 12%.) Tj T* () Tj T* (5.2 The Supplier will invoice monthly in arrears. The Customer will pay each invoice) Tj T* (within 30 days of receiving it.) Tj T* () Tj T* (5.3 Delivery is free for orders over £75. Smaller orders carry a delivery charge of) Tj T* (£6.50.) Tj T* () Tj T* (6. General) Tj T* () Tj T* (6.1 This agreement is governed by the law of England and Wales.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Signed for Fernhill Office Supplies Ltd and for Larkspur Housing Trust.) Tj T* () Tj T* ET
